olumnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>13</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>13</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>13</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>13</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"223\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
